# Apex ADE Project Structure Guide

## Overview
Apex ADE is a document extraction tool using Landing.ai SDK and GPT-5 for PDF processing with human-in-the-loop review.

## Backend Structure (FastAPI)
- Entry point: [backend/app/main.py](mdc:backend/app/main.py)
- API routes: [backend/app/api/api.py](mdc:backend/app/api/api.py)
- Config: [backend/app/core/config.py](mdc:backend/app/core/config.py)
- Database: SQLite with SQLAlchemy ORM at `backend/apex_ade.db`

## Frontend Structure (React/Vite)
- Entry: [frontend/src/main.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/main.tsx)
- Main app: [frontend/src/App.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/App.tsx)
- API client: [frontend/src/services/api.ts](mdc:frontend/src/services/api.ts)
- Build config: [frontend/vite.config.ts](mdc:frontend/vite.config.ts)

## Key Services
- Landing.ai integration: [backend/app/services/simple_landing_ai_service.py](mdc:backend/app/services/simple_landing_ai_service.py)
- OpenAI chat: [backend/app/services/openai_service.py](mdc:backend/app/services/openai_service.py)
- Markdown processing: [frontend/src/utils/enhancedMarkdownUtils.ts](mdc:frontend/src/utils/enhancedMarkdownUtils.ts)

## Important Notes
- Uses GPT-5 exclusively (no other OpenAI models)
- Maximum file size: 1GB
- Port 8000 (backend), Port 3000 (frontend)
- Environment variables required: VISION_AGENT_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY